+# BP-056 — DMA channels and spatialization
+
+- binds the 512-SFX, 128-channel, four-ambient and eight-dynamic limits;
+- fixes exact entity/channel replacement before free-channel allocation;
+- applies Binary32 semantics to attenuation, distance, panning and volume;
+- covers local sounds, ambient channels, stop behavior and channel combining;
+- adds 22 MiniLang fixtures and an independent C oracle.
